cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its released experiment artifacts, please cite it as below."
title: "CEmoSteer: Selective Attenuation and Partial Composition of Emotion Steering Directions Across Language Models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mamarin
    given-names: Georgy
  - family-names: Kliuchnikova
    given-names: Uliana
repository-code: "https://github.com/dmagog/persona-emotions"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline for extracting and evaluating contrastive activation directions
  for seven ISEAR emotions in instruction-tuned language models. It includes
  model configurations, prompts, extracted vectors, generated outputs, and
  evaluation artifacts for 11 models, including ordered-difference composition
  and dialogue experiments.
